@store_listing
This eye-care extension enables night mode by dynamically creating a dark theme for websites. Dark Reader inverts bright colors to produce a high-contrast effect for comfortable night reading.

You can adjust brightness, contrast, sepia filter, dark mode, font settings, and the ignore list.

Dark Reader Plus provides a premium user interface and customizable color themes.

This is the original Dark Reader extension. Since 2014 we have continued to evolve, keeping up with modern web technologies to deliver fast and reliable dark mode support for users sensitive to bright light.

By installing this extension you agree to these terms of use: https://darkreader.org/terms/

Please disable similar extensions to avoid conflicts. Happy browsing!
